<title>USA: EchoStar executive VP Vogel to leave.</title>
<headline>EchoStar executive VP Vogel to leave.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Colo 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>EchoStar Communications said Friday that its executive vice president, Carl Vogel, has decided to leave the company.</p>
<p>EchoStar said other executives would assume Vogel's responsibilities and that it does not plan to fill his post with a successor.</p>
</text>
